ut a  celebration for chadwick  slash t'challa we never really did see a  funeral for t'chaka when black panther  started it was a week after he died  and by that time he had to go to warrior  falls for the incarnation  so we know that wakanda picks a new  black panther very very soon after the  death of the previous black panther so i  would expect us to see a celebration of  t'challa's life and then not too long  after get a new black panther who i  think is going to be  shuri now kevin feige did mention that  they were going to explore  other characters in wakanda who were  introduced in the first  movie and those characters are of course  shuri queen  raimonda okoye nakia everett ross  and of course umbaku now umbaku could  challenge for the throne but considering  how close him and t'challa got at the  end  working together at the end of black  panther and of course an avengers  infinity war and avengers end game they  will probably go the route of him  honoring t'challa by letting his sister  become the black panther and keep it in  the family and of course in black  panther during the incoronation the rest  of the tribes didn't enter anybody to  fight t'challa for the throne so they'll  probably yield again as well and from  there we'll jump into the main story  which has a lot of rumors and reports  right now going on about what it could  be  atlantis was heavily rumored and  reported to be a part of black panther 2  however those reports were before the  passing of chadwick boseman  ryan has obviously rewritten the script  so who knows if atlantis will still be a  part of black panther 2 wakanda forever  so based off of everything that we've  heard so far that's pretty much  what we know about wakanda forever but  marvel revealed some official titles and  release dates for a few other movies in  the same trailer as this one  captain marvel 2 officially titled the  marvels is coming out november 11th of  2022  now we know that miss marvel is going to  heavil